  message: "Stripping tag under Phase 2 anomaly cleanup. Verdict: E-misapplied. This item is itself the bakeoff-validation WIRING task for WI-tihup + WI-mafik — its description is 'Bakeoff-validate WI-tihup + WI-mafik via BROAD cycle' with a 4-step workflow. It carries no own quantitative claim. The validation queue should track items whose fixes carry quantitative claims awaiting empirical confirmation, not the meta-orchestrator of validation work itself. Status stays needs_human_review (separate concern). When the user wants Phase 2 of the WI-nigah parent cohort to proceed, this item drives that work; tag was confusing because the item commands validation rather than awaiting it."  # 0eee
