  message: "A/B diff completed 2026-05-31 to convert the prior INCONCLUSIVE verdict into a conclusive one. Re-analyzed the same 6 cohort repos at pre-WI-mafik SHA 036e94aa20 (parent of be0ddcb8eb the analyzer-retrofit commit) vs post-WI-mafik HEAD 416f843499. Headline result on calls edges: 1109 total pre / 1109 total post; 485 resolved pre / 485 resolved post; 651 unresolved pre / 651 unresolved post. Zero net movement across all 6 repos. dst_ref structured field landed on JS only: 0 pre / 8 post on socketio-chat-example, 0/0 on the other 5. The +48 total-edge delta is entirely in contains edges from an unrelated improvement in the SHA range. Conclusive verdict: NO_MOVE on the headline call-resolution claim for this cohort, MOVED on dst_ref-on-JS. Interpretive note: this is a conclusive cohort verdict, not a global refutation. The polyglot-fixture path (WI-pisab-furis Level 2) is the actual contract spec for WI-mafik claims and CI confirms it passes. Real-world cohort BROAD bakeoffs aren't construct-targeted enough to validate analyzer-retrofit work; for future analyzer-retrofit validation, use the polyglot fixture path. Full A/B numbers in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/wi-kaziv-bakeoff-verdict-05312026.md §Verdict (revised after A/B diff)."  # b59e
