  message: "Closing as done. BROAD-cycle validation pattern exercised on 2026-05-31. Methodology finding recorded: random-cohort BROAD bakeoffs are not construct-targeted enough to validate analyzer-retrofit work; the polyglot fixture path (WI-pisab-furis Level 2, CI-gated) is the appropriate validation instrument for that class of claim. Cohort #1 A/B diff (pre-WI-mafik 036e94aa20 vs HEAD 416f843499) produced a conclusive NO_MOVE on call-resolution counts and MOVED on dst_ref-on-JS metadata. Neither target (WI-tihup unimplemented; WI-mafik already done and not in awaits_bakeoff_validation queue) needed manual tag-strip. Per-repo findings and methodology recommendation in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/wi-kaziv-bakeoff-verdict-05312026.md."  # 02db
